{"ticker":"PFG","updated":"2026-10-23T23:45:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Principal Financial Group, Inc.","shortName":"Principal Financial Group Inc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.principal.com","fullTimeEmployees":19700,"marketCap":23244271616,"trailingPE":15.4651,"forwardPE":10.608484,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4811684,"pegRatio":1.06,"targetMeanPrice":111.0,"targetHighPrice":128.0,"targetLowPrice":86.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.064,"earningsGrowth":0.028,"grossMargins":0.47345,"operatingMargins":0.12336001,"profitMargins":0.09932999,"totalRevenue":15693200384,"beta":0.871,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":121.18,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":79.45,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.05},"summary":"Principal Financial Group, Inc. provides retirement, asset management, and insurance products and services to businesses, individuals, and institutional clients worldwide. The company operates through Retirement and Income Solutions, Principal Asset Management, and Benefits and Protection segments. The Retirement and Income Solutions segment provides retirement, and related financial products and services. This segment offers products and services for defined contribution plans, including 401(k) and 403(b) plans, defined benefit plans, nonqualified executive benefit plans, employee stock ownership plans, equity compensation, and pension risk transfer services; individual retirement accounts; investment only products; and mutual funds, individual variable annuities, registered index-linked annuities, and bank products, as well as trust and custody services. The Principal Asset Management segment provides equity, fixed income, real estate, and other alternative investments, as well as fund offerings. This segment also offers pension accumulation products and services, mutual funds, asset management, income annuities, and life insurance accumulation products, as well as voluntary savings plans. The Benefits and Protection segment provides specialty benefits, such as specialty benefits group dental and vision insurance, group life and other insurance, and group and individual disab","summary_zh":"美國信安金融集團 (Principal Financial Group, Inc.) 為全球企業、個人和機構客戶提供退休、資產管理和保險產品及服務。該公司透過退休和收入解決方案、主要資產管理以及福利和保護部門進行營運。退休和收入解決方案部門提供退休及相關金融產品和服務。本部門提供固定繳款計畫的產品和服務，包括401(k)和403(b)計畫、固定福利計畫、非合格高階主管福利計畫、員工持股計畫、股權補償和退休金風險轉移服務；個人退休帳戶；僅供投資的產品；共同基金、個人可變年金、註冊指數掛鉤年金、銀行產品以及信託和託管服務。主要資產管理部門提供股權、固定收益、房地產和其他另類投資以及基金產品。該部門還提供退休金累積產品和服務、共同基金、資產管理、收入年金、人壽保險累積產品以及自願儲蓄計劃。福利和保護部門提供特殊福利，例如特殊福利團體牙科和視力保險、團體人壽和其他保險以及團體和個人殘疾保險","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":80.5,"h":80.89,"l":79.83,"c":80.28,"v":619100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":79.97,"h":80.59,"l":79.38,"c":80.55,"v":974500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":80.37,"h":81.37,"l":79.85,"c":80.84,"v":775400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":81.08,"h":81.16,"l":79.84,"c":80.22,"v":1248600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":80.3,"h":80.97,"l":80.2,"c":80.51,"v":974700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":79.56,"h":79.98,"l":78.63,"c":79.94,"v":1670500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":79.51,"h":80.19,"l":79.38,"c":80.18,"v":1431200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":79.74,"h":81.34,"l":79.59,"c":81.3,"v":1001400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":81.36,"h":82.0,"l":79.03,"c":79.98,"v":1125400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":79.91,"h":79.95,"l":78.11,"c":79.71,"v":908300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":79.8,"h":80.86,"l":79.73,"c":80.07,"v":1025400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":79.71,"h":80.6,"l":79.07,"c":80.07,"v":1137000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":80.4,"h":82.26,"l":80.14,"c":82.08,"v":1699400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":81.98,"h":82.93,"l":81.82,"c":82.7,"v":986000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":82.84,"h":83.64,"l":82.45,"c":82.95,"v":1493500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":82.92,"h":83.09,"l":79.74,"c":80.09,"v":1766400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":80.23,"h":82.21,"l":80.23,"c":80.86,"v":1249400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":80.83,"h":82.03,"l":80.47,"c":81.78,"v":801600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o"